# Colorado Notice of Restrictive Covenants

{% agreement-section type="cover_terms" %}
## Notice Information

{% cover-terms %}
{% cover-term kind="row" label="Employer" field="employer_name" /%}
{% cover-term kind="row" label="Worker" field="employee_name" /%}
{% cover-term kind="row" label="Agreement" field="agreement_name" /%}
{% cover-term kind="row" label="Notice Date" field="notice_date" /%}
{% cover-term kind="row" label="Worker Status" field="worker_status" /%}
{% /cover-terms %}
{% /agreement-section %}

{% agreement-section type="standard_terms" %}
## Important Notice

{% clause id="statutory-notice" %}
### This Agreement May Restrict Your Future Employment

The employer identified in the Notice Information above (Employer) is providing this notice about the {% field name="agreement_name" /%}. That agreement contains one or more covenants not to compete that could restrict your options for subsequent employment following your separation from Employer. A complete copy of that agreement accompanies this notice. Review each section identified below before signing.
{% /clause %}

{% clause id="notice-noncompetition" include-when="noncompete_included" %}
### Non-Competition

Review the section of the accompanying agreement titled **Non-Competition**.
{% /clause %}

{% clause id="notice-customer-nonsolicitation" include-when="customer_nonsolicit_included" %}
### Non-Solicitation of Customers

Review the section of the accompanying agreement titled **Non-Solicitation of Customers**.
{% /clause %}

{% clause id="notice-no-business" include-when="nondealing_included" %}
### No Business with Covered Customers

Review the section of the accompanying agreement titled **No Business with Covered Customers**.
{% /clause %}

{% clause id="notice-noninvestment" include-when="noninvestment_included" %}
### Non-Investment

Review the section of the accompanying agreement titled **Non-Investment**.
{% /clause %}

{% /agreement-section %}

{% agreement-section type="signature" %}
## Worker Acknowledgment

{% signature-block arrangement="entity-plus-individual" %}
By signing below, you acknowledge receiving this separate notice together with a complete copy of the agreement identified above. Your signature acknowledges receipt and does not waive any right.

{% signer id="employee" kind="individual" capacity="personal" label="Worker" %}
Worker: {% field name="employee_name" /%}

Signature: _______________
Date: _______________
{% /signer %}
{% /signature-block %}
{% /agreement-section %}
